"transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 58.9, "width": 36.9, "height": 22.9, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 58.9, "width": 36.9, "height": 22.9, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 58.9, "width": 36.9, "height": 22.9, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Proof: (\u2190) Convert E to equivalent TM M.\nM = for input w:\nSimulate E (on blank input).\nWhenever E prints x, test x = w.\nAccept if = and continue otherwise."]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 55, "height": 31.6, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_7", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 55, "height": 31.6, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_7", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 55, "height": 31.6, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Proof: (\u2192) Convert TM M to equivalent enumerator E.\nE = Simulate M on each wi in \u03a3* = {\u03b5, 0,1,00,01,10, ...}\nWhenever E prints x, test x = w.\nAccept if x = w and continue otherwise.\nProblem: What if M on wi loops?\nFix: Simulate M on w1